{
  "assembly_notes": "Three independent structural slots plus the support multiplicity over a fixed top and one moving leaf. top_style owns the leaf mechanism and exports the under-top interface; support_style consumes only that interface and reports its foot positions to foot_style. All 4x3x3 = 36 combinations build without a gate. Leaf and fold axes are solved by mate_axes and registered with register_interface_mate; leaves ride pins carried on cheeks that stay under the fixed top, so a swinging leaf never meets them.",
